# Contact sheets are DERIVED: make_contact_sheets.py rebuilds any of them from the
# bridge plus the recorded seed, so committing thousands of JPEGs would add tens of MB
# to the repository for something a one-line command reproduces.
#
# The MANIFEST is not derived in the same sense and IS tracked -- it carries the seed,
# the sequence-to-id mapping and the image hash, which is what makes a recorded reading
# traceable back to the photograph it was made from.
outputs/sheets/*/

# Downscaled image cache. Lives outside the repo (AppData) by design; this entry only
# catches a run that was pointed somewhere else by mistake.
cache/
